strings.closed_body:
{game} started loading mods from folders that weren't checked first:

{folders}

Start the game again and they'll be checked before anything loads.

strings.update_body:
Steam just downloaded an update to this mod, and it looks malicious:

{reasons}

It's been moved to quarantine before it could load. The copy in this game session is the earlier version, which was checked. Please unsubscribe from it on Steam.

strings.demo_body_play:
In real use, {game} would start now with the clean mod, and the malicious one would be in quarantine. {kept}

Next launch, if nothing has changed, there's no window at all: the game starts in about half a second.

Nothing was scanned, moved or started.
